<title>POLAND: BETONSTAL OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.2 MLN PROFIT.</title>
<headline>BETONSTAL OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.2 MLN PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.15 vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.15 vs   0.03 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.22 vs   0.07 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    2.95 vs   0.82</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.42 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.47 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.74 vs   0.08 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   16.57 vs   7.29</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>BetonStal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
